OL,3,GNEWSAAbattoir worker sentenced for
OL,4,Awalking on sheep
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former abattoir worker has been
OL,7,Fordered to carry out 80 hours of unpaid
OL,8,Fwork after admitting to animal cruelty
OL,9,Fby forcing a sheep against a door and
OL,10,Fwalking on its back.
OL,12,FKhawaja Hussain, 26, was sentenced at
OL,13,FWarwickshire Justice Centre on Friday,
OL,14,Fwhere he was also ordered to pay a
OL,15,Fvictim surcharge of #114 and costs of
OL,16,F#85.
OL,18,FHe pleaded guilty to causing
OL,19,Funnecessary suffering to a protected
OL,20,Fanimal in August 2024.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
