OL,3,GNEWSAAbattoir worker sentenced for
OL,4,Awalking on sheep
OL,5,
OL,6,FHussain worked at T&S Abattoir in
OL,7,FArley, Warwickshire, which closed last
OL,8,Fyear following a probe into animal
OL,9,Fwelfare by the Food Standards Agency
OL,10,F(FSA).
